(see LICENSE).

Compiled dataset releases (including MNMF mmap snapshots, SQLite exports,
MNL1 lite databases, and MNCC country databases) aggregate third-party internet
routing, allocation, and geolocation datasets whose underlying terms remain in
effect:

1. IP Geolocation Fallback (DB-IP City Lite)
   Fallback city, region, and coordinate records include IP Geolocation data by
   DB-IP (https://db-ip.com), licensed under Creative Commons Attribution 4.0
   International (CC BY 4.0): https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/
   Downstream redistributors of compiled dataset releases must preserve this
   attribution.

2. Regional Internet Registries (RIR / IRR Bulk Data)
   IP allocation, ASN aut-num, and route records are derived from public bulk
   delegated and WHOIS/IRR datasets published by RIPE NCC, ARIN, APNIC, LACNIC,
   and AFRINIC, and remain subject to each registry's respective terms of use
   and acceptable use policies.

3. Operator Geofeeds (RFC 8805)
   Primary geofeed location overrides are fetched from network-operator
   published RFC 8805 CSV feeds referenced by RIR remarks/geofeed attributes.
